167660	167736	167880	167880	he	5200	“ What I have been thinking as we came along , and what I am still thinking now , as I look into your kind strong face which gives me so much support , is this:--If the Republic really does good to the poor , and they come to be less hungry , and in all ways to suffer less , she may live a long time : she may even live to be old . ”
